      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 01 · AI Lead Qualification System\nScores inbound leads 0-100 with AI, alerts sales on hot leads and logs every lead to Google Sheets.\n\n**Trigger:** `POST /webhook/lead-qualification` (JSON body)\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit the **Config** node (model, sheet URL, endpoints).\n2. Connect credentials: Google Sheets OAuth2, OpenAI API, Slack.\n3. Pick Slack channels / sheet tabs on the action nodes.\n4. Activate.\n\n**Sample payload:**\n```json\n{\n \"name\": \"Asha Rao\",\n \"email\": \"asha@acme.io\",\n \"company\": \"Acme Logistics\",\n \"role\": \"Head of Ops\",\n \"employees\": 250,\n \"message\": \"We need to automate dispatch by next quarter, budget approved.\"\n}\n```"
      }
    }
